<title>USA: Hakuto ups Pfeiffer stake to 6 pct.</title>
<headline>Hakuto ups Pfeiffer stake to 6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hakuto Co Ltd said Wednesday it raised its stake in Pfeiffer Vacuum Technology Ag to 371,500 American Depositary Shares, or 6.0 percent of the total outstanding, from 310,000 ADSs, or 5.0 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Hakuto said its purpose in acquiring the stake was for investment and &quot;in order to strengthen Hakuto's working relationship&quot; with Pfeiffer.</p>
</text>
